{
  "id": "everbrook-village-square",
  "defaultLang": "en",
  "title": "Everbrook — Village Square (invented demo story, placeholder)",
  "description": "A cozy-fantasy village square at golden hour, gray-box placeholder geometry. Cottages ring a well at the centre; a brook runs along the eastern edge; two market stalls sit in the warm evening light. Entirely invented for this demo — no story canon.",
  "worldTexture": [
    "invented demo location — not tied to any real project's canon",
    "golden hour, warm low sun, long soft shadows",
    "amber and cream palette with terracotta roofs, not the noir street's green",
    "a village square: cottages, a well, market stalls, a brook — no people, no vehicles"
  ],
